      "principle": "Subjecting a person to undergo trial in which they are ultimately acquitted can be regarded as an act of mental cruelty.",
      "held": "Compelling the appellant to undergo the rigours of the criminal trial, in which ultimately he got a verdict of acquittal, is in itself an act of mental cruelty by the respondent.",
